        exam: [.direct("Tell the jury what you found when you arrived at the scene.", "\"{V} was on the driveway, already dead. There was a single wound to the chest, and a shovel lay a few feet away with its blade on the concrete.\""), .direct("What did you find at {V}'s driveway on {DATE}?", "\"{V} was dead on the driveway from a single wound to the chest. It followed an argument with a neighbor, {D}, over a fallen tree.\""), .direct("What did the neighbor tell you?", "\"A neighbor saw {DL} walk away from the driveway holding a hatchet. That led us to {DL}'s property.\""), .direct("What did you find in {DL}'s shed?", "\"A hatchet with {V}'s blood on it. The autopsy found a single chest wound, which fits the weapon we recovered.\""), .direct("What did the neighbor across the road tell you?", "\"The neighbor saw {DL} walk away from the driveway carrying something that looked like a hatchet. The neighbor couldn't say what happened before that.\""), .direct("What did you notice about {V}'s driveway when you arrived?", "\"A shovel lay near {V}'s hand, and a dropped hatchet case sat near the porch. The chest wound was a single injury, and nothing else looked disturbed.\""), .cross("{DL} says {V} came at {D.him} first, doesn't {D.he}?", "\"I wasn't there. A neighbor across the road says {V} raised a shovel, and I take that seriously.\""), .cross("Was a shovel found at the scene?", "\"There was a shovel near the driveway. I can't tell you what it was doing in {V}'s hands, only where it was found.\""), .cross("Did {DL} try to hide the hatchet?", "\"It was in the shed, not buried or thrown away. {D.He} didn't run, and {D.he} spoke to us when we arrived.\""), .cross("Was the shovel near {V}'s hand?", "\"It was about three feet from {V}'s right hand. I can't tell you whether it was in {V}'s hand when the wound was made.\""), .cross("Did {D} cooperate with your investigation?", "\"Yes. {D.He} told me about the argument, showed me the hatchet, and said it was self-defense.\"")],
        defenseRole: "Neighbor across the road",
        defenseExam: [.direct("What did you see from across the road?", "\"I saw {V} and {D} arguing in the driveway. At one point {V} raised a shovel, and then it all went very fast.\""), .direct("What was {V} doing with the shovel?", "\"Raising it up, like to swing or strike. It was over {V}'s shoulder, and {V} stepped toward {DF}.\""), .direct("What did you do?", "\"I stood there frozen, and then I called for help. I didn't want to get involved, but I knew something terrible had happened.\""), .direct("How do you know {D} and {V}?", "\"I live across the road from both of them. We've been neighbors for about ten years and we talk over the fence.\""), .direct("What did you see that afternoon?", "\"I was in my yard when I heard raised voices. I saw {V} pick up a shovel and raise it over {DF}.\""), .direct("What happened after that?", "\"It went quickly. I saw {DF} swing, and then {V} fell. I ran inside and called 911.\""), .cross("How far away were you?", "\"Across the road. It's maybe fifty yards. I could see them but not every detail, and I'd say I saw the shovel clearly.\""), .cross("Were you looking the whole time?", "\"Mostly. I looked away for a moment when I heard the first shout. I can't say I saw every second.\""), .cross("Do you get along with {DL}?", "\"Fine. We're neighbors and wave. But I'm telling you what I saw, and I'd say it even if I didn't know {D.him}.\""), .cross("How far were you from the driveway?", "\"About fifty yards. I could see clearly, but I couldn't hear every word.\""), .cross("Did you see the defendant carrying the hatchet before the argument?", "\"I think so. {D.He} had been cutting up the fallen tree that morning.\"")],
        theory: ("{D} killed a neighbor.", "A defense."),
